  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The opportunity aims at reducing the impacts of heatwaves using Artificial Intelligence. This involves developing an automated dashboard called Heat-AI. This dashboard will collect data from various sources, including ground level observations and other credible data sources and visualize the information through heat-land effects, highlighting hotspot areas and offer recommendations for preparedness and to act in anticipation.</narrative>
  </description>
